  "text": "proprium.assumptio-beatae-mariae-virginis-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Assumption of the Blessed Virgin Mary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "May the offering of our devotion rise unto You, O Lord, and by the intercession of the most Blessed Virgin Mary, who was taken up into heaven, may our hearts, on fire with love, strive ever upward to You. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen."
    }
  },
